<h1>Password Reset Request</h1>
<p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
<p>We received a request to reset the password for your {{companyName}} account. Enter the 6-digit verification code below to authorize your password reset:</p>

<div class="otp-box">
  <span class="otp-code">{{otpCode}}</span>
  <span class="otp-timer">Expires in 10 minutes</span>
</div>

<div class="security-notice">
  <strong>Didn't request a password reset?</strong> You can safely ignore this email. Your current password will remain unchanged and your account stays protected.
</div>
